# Clears Lost Prologue, Paragraph 01 (collect 50 rings) from a fresh save and goes through
# the results so the game saves. The ring count is poked to 49 first (test-save
# preparation only: poke changes game state).
include boot_stage1.tas
wait 5
poke u32 9102d378 49
poke u32 9102d37c 49
poke u32 9102e0e0 49
poke u32 91efc544 49
poke u32 91efcdf8 49
shot clear1_poked
repeat 5
mash A 10 2
end
shot clear1_results
repeat 10
mash B 4 1
shot clear1_after
mash A 2 1
shot clear1_after
end
quit
